      "content": "but it doesn't feel like i can just \"find a path forward.\" every time i try, i just see their faces and how much they expect from me. it's like i'm carrying this massive weight that i'm just not strong enough for. if i can't be the success they need me to be, then what was the point of any of it? it feels like the only way to actually stop being a disappointment is to just... not be around to disappoint them anymore.",
